msgstr "Instalação do Fuse"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/postlfs/filesystems/fuse3.xml:112
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"Install <application>Fuse</application> by running the following commands:"
msgstr ""
"Instale <application>Fuse</application> executando os seguintes comandos:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/postlfs/filesystems/fuse3.xml:116
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput>sed -i '/^udev/,$ s/^/#/' util/meson.build &amp;&amp;\n"
"\n"
"mkdir build &amp;&amp;\n"
"cd    build &amp;&amp;\n"
"\n"
"meson setup --prefix=/usr --buildtype=release .. &amp;&amp;\n"
"ninja</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput>sed -i '/^udev/,$ s/^/#/' util/meson.build &amp;&amp;\n"
"\n"
"mkdir build &amp;&amp;\n"
"cd    build &amp;&amp;\n"
"\n"
"meson setup --prefix=/usr --buildtype=release .. &amp;&amp;\n"
"ninja</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/postlfs/filesystems/fuse3.xml:125
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"The API documentation is included in the package, but if you have <xref "
"linkend=\"doxygen\"/> installed and wish to rebuild it, issue:"
msgstr ""
"A documentação da API está incluída no pacote, mas se você tiver o <xref "
"linkend=\"doxygen\"/> instalado e quiser reconstruí-la, [então] emita:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/postlfs/filesystems/fuse3.xml:130
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput>pushd .. &amp;&amp;\n"
"  doxygen doc/Doxyfile &amp;&amp;\n"
"popd</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput>pushd .. &amp;&amp;\n"
"  doxygen doc/Doxyfile &amp;&amp;\n"
"popd</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/postlfs/filesystems/fuse3.xml:135
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"To test the results, issue the following commands (as the <systemitem "
"role=\"username\">root</systemitem> user):"
msgstr ""
"Para testar os resultados, emita os seguintes comandos (como o(a) usante "
"<systemitem role=\"username\">root</systemitem>):"

#.  EDITORS NOTE:
#.          Don't use 'pytest' instead of 'python3 -m pytest'.  There is no
#.          testenv/bin/pytest (as at pytest-7.4.0) so 'pytest' resolves to
#.          /usr/bin/pytest, and the shebang of it is /usr/bin/python3.11.
#.          So it won't find the looseversion installed in testenv.
#.          To view the results of the tests, look for
#.          "short test summary info" at the end of your log. Below skipped
#. tests,
#.          you will see "X passed, X skipped, X failed (if any) in X seconds"
#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/postlfs/filesystems/fuse3.xml:150
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput>python3 -m venv --system-site-packages testenv &amp;&amp;\n"
"source testenv/bin/activate                    &amp;&amp;\n"
"pip3 install looseversion                      &amp;&amp;\n"
"python3 -m pytest\n"
"deactivate</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput>python3 -m venv --system-site-packages testenv &amp;&amp;\n"
"source testenv/bin/activate                    &amp;&amp;\n"
"pip3 install looseversion                      &amp;&amp;\n"
"python3 -m pytest\n"
"deactivate</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/postlfs/filesystems/fuse3.xml:157
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"The <xref linkend=\"pytest\"/> Python module is required for the tests. One "
"test named <filename>test_cuse</filename> will fail if the "
"<parameter>CONFIG_CUSE</parameter> configuration item was not enabled when "
"the kernel was built. One test, <filename>test/util.py</filename>, will "
"output a warning due to the usage of an unknown mark in pytest."
msgstr ""
"O módulo Python <xref linkend=\"pytest\"/> é exigido para os testes. Um "
"teste chamado <filename>test_cuse</filename> falhará se o item de "
"configuração <parameter>CONFIG_CUSE</parameter> não foi habilitado quando o "
"núcleo foi construído. Um teste, <filename>test/util.py</filename>, gerará "
"um aviso devido ao uso de uma marca desconhecida no pytest."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/postlfs/filesystems/fuse3.xml:167
#, xml-text
msgid "Now, as the <systemitem class=\"username\">root</systemitem> user:"
msgstr "Agora, como o(a) usante <systemitem class=\"username\">root</systemitem>:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/postlfs/filesystems/fuse3.xml:170
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput>ninja install                  &amp;&amp;\n"
"chmod u+s /usr/bin/fusermount3 &amp;&amp;\n"
"\n"
"cd ..                          &amp;&amp;\n"
"cp -Rv doc/html -T /usr/share/doc/fuse-&fuse3-version; &amp;&amp;\n"
"install -v -m644   doc/{README.NFS,kernel.txt} \\\n"
"                   /usr/share/doc/fuse-&fuse3-version;</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput>ninja install                  &amp;&amp;\n"
"chmod u+s /usr/bin/fusermount3 &amp;&amp;\n"
"\n"
"cd ..                          &amp;&amp;\n"
"cp -Rv doc/html -T /usr/share/doc/fuse-&fuse3-version; &amp;&amp;\n"
"install -v -m644   doc/{README.NFS,kernel.txt} \\\n"
"                   /usr/share/doc/fuse-&fuse3-version;</userinput>"

